      <shape width="66.94629921259842" height="50.8" topLeftX="33.25511811023622" topLeftY="15.769133858267715" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="36" fontFamily="锐字真言体免费商用" strikethrough="false" underline="false">02</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="560" height="36.25" topLeftX="110.86724409448817" topLeftY="33.10251968503937" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><em><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">不写 Delay，怎么让灯一秒一闪？</span></em></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="124" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">① 记时间戳，不记「等多久」</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">用 HAL_GetTick() 记住上一次动作的时刻，主循环里只需要判断过去了多久。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="194" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">② 到点才动，其余时间自由</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">没到时间就跳过，主循环可以同时读按键、发串口、算控制，互不耽误。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430" height="66" topLeftX="62.42" topLeftY="264" type="text">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><strong><span color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源黑体" strikethrough="false" underline="false">③ 多个周期怎么办</span></strong></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">每个任务各存一个时间戳，各判各的；也可以用定时器中断，到点置标志，主循环只管干活。</span></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="378" height="230" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="112" type="rect">
        <fill>
          <fillColor color="rgba(240, 240, 240, 1)"/>
        </fill>
        <border color="rgba(3, 72, 149, 1)" width="1" lineJoin="miter" miterLimit="10"/>
